  "description": "Madonna V3.2 Fox Podium Build\nThis rolling chassis now ships with the updated Madonna V3.2 frame. The pictures still show the frame with the previous dropouts.\nThe Fox Podium upside-down fork is the centerpiece of this Madonna build, the brand new fork with MX vibes, a big crown and leg guards, not only looks the part, but its hard-charging position next to Fox’ already dominant 38 makes it a perfect fit to the Madonna, sharing the same intentions.\nAlso completely new are the XTR Di2 drivetrain and brakes. The wireless electronic shifting and 4-piston brakes are the new benchmark for a Madonna and the short cranks are a great addition to our low BB.\nMadonna Fox Podium builds come with the Fox shock of your choice and the silver Newmen Beskar 30 rims. These are paired with the tried and true Maxxis Assegai DHRII tyre combination, and we finish off the bike with OneUp and Ergon components for the cockpit, dropper and saddle.\nIf you want to learn more about the shock choice or the two different rocker link options, you can find all details about the Madonna on this page.\nTo get you off to a good start in building your new bike, we've already pressed the headset cups into the frame, mounted the crown race on the fork and cut the steerer tube to length. The tubeless tape and valves are also installed, you’ll just need to add in some sealant. The rest of the components are ready for you to assemble – this way you can truly experience the build process from the ground up and get to know your new bike and all its technical details. But you’re never on your own, as our support is always there if you need help building and can’t find the answer you’re after in our extensive knowledge base.\nThe frames are regularly available with the rocker link options shown in the selection on the side. If you prefer a different rocker link, please send us an e-mail to hello@raawmtb.com and we will check the availability of the preferred configuration.\nIn case you want to pick the bike up, we can fully assemble it. Please reach out to us so that we can prepare everything in time.",
